11
00:50:06,666 --> 00:50:12,666
Kevin & Perry Go Large is a 2000 British teen coming-of-age sex comedy
film based on the Harry Enfield sketch Kevin the Teenager.

12
00:54:40,000 --> 00:54:46,000
The film was written by Dave Cummings and Harry Enfield and directed by Ed Bye.

13
00:59:13,333 --> 00:59:19,333
Enfield, Kathy Burke and Louisa Rix all return to their roles
after previously appearing on Harry Enfield & Chums.

14
01:03:46,666 --> 01:03:52,666
James Fleet replaced Stephen Moore as Kevin's father.

15
01:08:20,000 --> 01:08:26,000
